Output demo/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1240
Set Height 590
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 120ms

Hide
Type "bash demo/sessions.sh /tmp/demo && export HOME=/home/demo CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=/tmp/demo PS1='$ ' && alias cr=$PWD/claude-resume && clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "cr"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Sleep 1500ms

Down
Sleep 1800ms
Down
Sleep 1800ms
Down
Sleep 1800ms

Type "blog"
Sleep 1500ms
Down
Sleep 2s

Ctrl+U
Sleep 600ms
Type "shop"
Sleep 1500ms
Down
Sleep 1800ms
Down
Sleep 2500ms
